Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The proof reconstructs and is non-vacuous, but its unbounded-stack semantics returns normally for inputs where the real Python program raises `RecursionError`, materially violating the unrestricted contract.

- [Detailed review](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)
- [Audit evidence](/audit-output/evidence/05_recursion_semantics_witness.log)
